1. WHAT YOU MAY DO

   a) Use the official apps. Open the official website, or download an official
      build from this repository's Releases page, and use it for any purpose,
      including commercial work. No payment and no sign-up are needed.

   b) Own your pictures. Everything you create with Gradient Gen (pictures,
      palettes, presets) belongs to you. You may use it anywhere without credit.
      This licence puts no limit on what you create.

   c) Read the source. You may view and study the source code to learn from it,
      to review its security, or to check what the app does.

   d) Fork and contribute. You may copy the repository to your own GitHub account
      to the extent GitHub's Terms of Service allow, and to prepare a contribution
      (a pull request) to this project.

   e) Try it privately. You may build and run a private copy on your own computer
      to test how it works or to test a contribution. You may not share it.

